{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [–] | [D] [A/C#] | [Bm] | [G] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Walking in the [D]light as He is in the [Bm]light
[G]Fellowship with one [A]another [D]shines
No more lying when the truth [A/C#]is near [Bm]
We do not [G]practice what [A]is clear [D]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
If we claim [G]no sin we de[A]ceive ourselves
The truth [D]is miss[A/C#]ing from [Bm7]our lives
But [G]in the dark we cannot stay
[A]We must turn and find the way
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[D]If we con[A/C#]fess our sins
[Bm]He is [A]faithful and just
