[Em7]And cleanse us [A]as we trust
[D]From all un[A/C#]righteousness
[Bm7]His love [A6]never [G]ends
[A]Faithful and [D][A/C#]just [Bm]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Saying we have [D]sinned [A/C#]makes Him a [Bm]liar
[Bm7/A]His [G]word is not [A]in us [D]
But when we speak the truth we [A/C#]find
A [Bm7]heart that is kind [A6]and blind
To [G]no confession that is real
His [A]grace is pure and [D]steel
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
The [G]blood of Jesus [A]cleanses us
[D]From all [A/C#]sin and [Bm7]all abuse
We [G]walk together in the light
Our [A]shadows fade from sight
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
